            "item:category:unarmed"
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "ability",
      "name": "Zagresh's Gaze",
      "actions": 1,
      "category": "offensive",
      "text": "Frequency once per day\n\n---\nEffect The oracle of Zagresh throws aside her weapons and focuses on the pure divine power of destruction. She attempts a DC 27 Will save save. On a success, she gains access to her claw and jaws Strikes. This effect lasts 1d4 rounds.",
